1
00:00:02,509 --> 00:00:03,885
KATARA: Water.

2
00:00:04,886 --> 00:00:06,054
Earth.

3
00:00:06,846 --> 00:00:08,139
Fire.

4
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:10,183
Air.

5
00:00:11,017 --> 00:00:14,979
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:18,733
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,692 --> 00:00:22,529
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

8
00:00:22,612 --> 00:00:23,821
could stop them.

9
00:00:23,905 --> 00:00:26,658
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

10
00:00:27,158 --> 00:00:29,744
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I discovered

11
00:00:29,827 --> 00:00:32,664
the new Avatar,
an Airbender named Aang.

12
00:00:32,914 --> 00:00:35,041
And although
his airbending skills are great,

13
00:00:35,124 --> 00:00:37,710
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

14
00:00:37,794 --> 00:00:38,920
AANG: Oof!

15
00:00:39,003 --> 00:00:41,965
KATARA: But I believe
Aang can save the world.

16
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,778
( ZUKO YAWNING )

17
00:01:00,654 --> 00:01:01,863
What's that smell?

18
00:01:02,697 --> 00:01:06,201
It's jook. I'm sure
you wouldn't like it.

19
00:01:07,327 --> 00:01:08,870
( INHALING )

20
00:01:08,954 --> 00:01:12,707
Actually, it smells delicious.
I'd love a bowl, Uncle.

21
00:01:14,542 --> 00:01:18,755
Now that your fever is gone,
you seem different somehow.

22
00:01:19,422 --> 00:01:21,132
It's a new day.

23
00:01:21,258 --> 00:01:23,218
We've got a new apartment,
new furniture,

24
00:01:23,343 --> 00:01:26,012
and today's the grand opening
of your new tea shop.

25
00:01:26,137 --> 00:01:29,140
Things are looking up, Uncle.
( SIPPING )

26
00:01:33,603 --> 00:01:35,689
You haven't seen your
Dad in over two years.

27
00:01:35,855 --> 00:01:37,232
You must be so excited.

28
00:01:37,315 --> 00:01:38,483
( RETCHES )

29
00:01:38,566 --> 00:01:41,861
I know I should be, but I just
feel sick to my stomach.

30
00:01:42,404 --> 00:01:45,699
Don't be nervous, he's gonna
be so happy to see you.

31
00:01:45,824 --> 00:01:46,908
So what about you?

32
00:01:47,033 --> 00:01:48,618
Are you nervous
to meet this Guru?

33
00:01:48,702 --> 00:01:49,953
Not at all.

34
00:01:50,036 --> 00:01:51,830
I'm ready to master
the Avatar State.

35
00:01:51,955 --> 00:01:53,456
I'll do whatever it takes.

36
00:01:55,750 --> 00:01:57,002
See you in a week.

37
00:01:57,127 --> 00:01:58,628
Yip! Yip!

38
00:02:01,423 --> 00:02:03,049
( SIGHS HEAVILY )

39
00:02:14,269 --> 00:02:17,063
- Sokka, good to see you.
-( WARRIORS LAUGHING )

40
00:02:36,082 --> 00:02:37,250
Sokka.

41
00:02:38,126 --> 00:02:39,336
Hi, Dad.

42
00:02:46,217 --> 00:02:47,677
Look, Bosco,

43
00:02:47,761 --> 00:02:50,972
the Kyoshi Warriors
are here to protect us.

44
00:02:51,097 --> 00:02:52,891
Aren't you excited?

45
00:02:53,016 --> 00:02:54,809
( YAWNING )

46
00:02:54,934 --> 00:02:56,644
It's been a difficult
week for me.

47
00:02:56,770 --> 00:02:59,731
My most trusted advisor,
Long Feng, and his Dai Li agents

48
00:02:59,814 --> 00:03:02,275
tried to take control
of Ba Sing Se from me.

49
00:03:02,567 --> 00:03:05,820
It's terrible when you can't trust
the people who are closest to you.

50
00:03:06,029 --> 00:03:07,739
But there is good news.

51
00:03:07,864 --> 00:03:11,493
As we speak, the Council of Five
is meeting to plan an invasion

52
00:03:11,618 --> 00:03:15,872
of The Fire Nation this summer―
On the day of a solar eclipse.

53
00:03:15,997 --> 00:03:17,540
Really?

54
00:03:17,665 --> 00:03:21,252
Now that sounds like
a fascinating and brilliant plan.

55
00:03:26,591 --> 00:03:27,801
General Fong's base

56
00:03:27,926 --> 00:03:30,387
will serve as the launching
point for the attack.

57
00:03:30,512 --> 00:03:34,057
In exactly two months,
the Army and Navy will invade

58
00:03:34,182 --> 00:03:37,143
the Fire Nation
on The Day of Black Sun.

59
00:03:37,894 --> 00:03:40,855
Or we could send in
Momo to do some damage.

60
00:03:40,980 --> 00:03:43,191
( LAUGHING ) 'Cause the...

61
00:03:43,316 --> 00:03:44,651
Sorry.

62
00:03:46,528 --> 00:03:47,779
( SCREECHING )

63
00:03:48,405 --> 00:03:50,323
All we need is
the Earth King's seal

64
00:03:50,407 --> 00:03:52,075
in order to execute
the plan.

65
00:03:54,577 --> 00:03:56,496
I'll get these scrolls
to him right away.

66
00:03:56,579 --> 00:03:58,248
Thank you, General How.

67
00:03:59,416 --> 00:04:01,126
( APPA GRUNTING )

68
00:04:15,598 --> 00:04:17,434
Um, hello?

69
00:04:19,394 --> 00:04:21,146
You're Guru Pathik, right?

70
00:04:21,396 --> 00:04:23,648
The person who attached
the note to Appa's horn?

71
00:04:23,898 --> 00:04:25,108
Indeed.

72
00:04:25,191 --> 00:04:27,652
I was a spiritual brother
of your people,

73
00:04:27,735 --> 00:04:30,321
and a personal friend
of Monk Gyatso.

74
00:04:31,281 --> 00:04:33,241
In your note, you said
you could teach me

75
00:04:33,366 --> 00:04:35,326
to gain control
of the Avatar State.

76
00:04:35,410 --> 00:04:36,536
How?

77
00:04:36,619 --> 00:04:39,456
You must gain balance
within yourself

78
00:04:39,539 --> 00:04:42,292
before you can bring
balance to the world.

79
00:04:42,417 --> 00:04:45,795
And the first step to gaining
balance begins with this.

80
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,172
Drink up.

81
00:04:48,923 --> 00:04:50,300
( SIPPING, SPITTING )

82
00:04:50,383 --> 00:04:51,509
Ugh!

83
00:04:51,593 --> 00:04:53,887
It tastes like onion
and banana juice!

84
00:04:54,512 --> 00:04:56,014
That's because it is.

85
00:04:56,139 --> 00:04:58,141
( SLURPING ) Yum! Yum!

86
00:05:02,061 --> 00:05:04,147
I believe we need to go right!

87
00:05:04,230 --> 00:05:05,565
What are you talking about?

88
00:05:05,690 --> 00:05:07,692
The Bei Fong Estate's this way.

89
00:05:07,817 --> 00:05:09,736
I'm quite certain
you're mistaken.

90
00:05:09,819 --> 00:05:11,029
( LOUD BANGING )

91
00:05:11,112 --> 00:05:13,990
Hey, can you two old ladies quit
your bickering for a second?

92
00:05:14,073 --> 00:05:15,950
I gotta go to the bathroom!

93
00:05:16,159 --> 00:05:18,244
Oh... Uh...

94
00:05:18,369 --> 00:05:20,538
Okay, but make it quick.

95
00:05:20,997 --> 00:05:22,957
What's wrong with you?!

96
00:05:23,041 --> 00:05:25,793
Oh, very sneaky, Toph!

97
00:05:26,127 --> 00:05:29,172
Nice try,
but you can't trick me.

98
00:05:29,714 --> 00:05:32,592
Let me outta here,
so I can kick both your butts!

99
00:05:32,717 --> 00:05:34,469
Quit your banging!

100
00:05:34,594 --> 00:05:37,305
You might think you're
the greatest Earthbender

101
00:05:37,388 --> 00:05:40,308
in the world,
but even you can't bend metal.

102
00:05:50,151 --> 00:05:53,780
We've been presented with
an extraordinary opportunity, girls.

103
00:05:53,905 --> 00:05:57,075
Mai finally gets to wear makeup
that's not totally depressing?

104
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:58,743
Ha. Ha.

105
00:05:58,868 --> 00:06:03,289
I'm talking about conquering
the whole Earth Kingdom.

106
00:06:03,414 --> 00:06:06,292
For a hundred years
the Fire Nation has hammered away

107
00:06:06,376 --> 00:06:08,920
at Ba Sing Se from the outside.

108
00:06:09,003 --> 00:06:13,633
But now we are on the inside,
and we can take it by ourselves.

109
00:06:13,967 --> 00:06:17,887
Gosh, you're so confident.
I really admire that about you.

110
00:06:18,304 --> 00:06:20,473
From the inside,
we're in the perfect position

111
00:06:20,598 --> 00:06:23,476
to organize a coup
and overthrow the Earth King.

112
00:06:23,601 --> 00:06:25,937
The key is the Dai Li.

113
00:06:26,062 --> 00:06:29,566
Whoever controls the Dai Li,
controls Ba Sing Se.

114
00:06:34,571 --> 00:06:37,240
In order to master the Avatar State,

115
00:06:37,365 --> 00:06:40,159
you must open all the chakras.

116
00:06:40,702 --> 00:06:43,955
Aang, tell me everything
you know about chakras.

117
00:06:44,414 --> 00:06:45,999
What are chakras?

118
00:06:46,624 --> 00:06:48,376
Oh, I see.

119
00:06:48,501 --> 00:06:50,712
I guess we'll start
with the basics.

120
00:06:51,796 --> 00:06:53,590
The water flows
through this creek

121
00:06:53,673 --> 00:06:56,759
much like the energy flows
through your body.

122
00:06:57,176 --> 00:06:58,928
As you see,
there are several pools

123
00:06:59,012 --> 00:07:01,848
where the water swirls
around before flowing on.

124
00:07:02,265 --> 00:07:05,059
These pools are
like our chakras.

125
00:07:05,476 --> 00:07:08,813
So, chakras are pools
of spiraling energy in our bodies?

126
00:07:09,063 --> 00:07:12,442
Exactly. If nothing else were around,

127
00:07:12,567 --> 00:07:15,236
this creek would
flow pure and clear.

128
00:07:15,361 --> 00:07:17,363
However, life is messy,

129
00:07:17,447 --> 00:07:19,449
and things tend
to fall in the creek,

130
00:07:19,532 --> 00:07:21,618
and then what happens?

131
00:07:21,909 --> 00:07:24,203
- The creek can't flow?
- Yes.

132
00:07:24,579 --> 00:07:28,124
But if we open the paths
between the pools...

133
00:07:28,207 --> 00:07:29,834
The energy flows!

134
00:07:29,917 --> 00:07:32,128
( WATER GURGLING )

135
00:07:35,423 --> 00:07:38,217
There are seven chakras
that go up the body.

136
00:07:38,343 --> 00:07:40,637
Each pool of energy
has a purpose,

137
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:44,265
and can be blocked by a
specific kind of emotional muck.

138
00:07:44,682 --> 00:07:49,228
Be warned― Opening the chakras
is an intense experience,

139
00:07:49,354 --> 00:07:51,272
and once you begin
this process,

140
00:07:51,397 --> 00:07:54,984
you cannot stop until
all seven are open.

141
00:07:55,109 --> 00:07:56,569
Are you ready?

142
00:07:58,655 --> 00:08:00,156
I'll do whatever it takes.

143
00:08:00,657 --> 00:08:03,242
First we will open the Earth chakra,

144
00:08:03,368 --> 00:08:05,495
located at the base
of the spine.

145
00:08:05,787 --> 00:08:09,332
It deals with survival
and is blocked by fear.

146
00:08:09,957 --> 00:08:11,793
What are you most afraid of?

147
00:08:13,086 --> 00:08:15,463
Let your fears
become clear to you.

148
00:08:18,383 --> 00:08:20,635
( SCREAMING )

149
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:29,268
( SCREAMING )

150
00:08:29,352 --> 00:08:32,689
GURU: Aang, your vision is not real.

151
00:08:32,980 --> 00:08:35,149
You are concerned
for your survival,

152
00:08:35,233 --> 00:08:37,652
but you must surrender
those fears.

153
00:08:37,944 --> 00:08:41,280
Let your fears
flow down the creek.

154
00:08:45,201 --> 00:08:47,578
You have opened
your Earth chakra.

155
00:08:48,329 --> 00:08:49,497
Whew.

156
00:08:51,416 --> 00:08:53,876
( WATER CASCADING )

157
00:08:57,547 --> 00:09:00,049
- Next is the...
- Water chakra?

158
00:09:00,133 --> 00:09:01,300
Brilliant!

159
00:09:01,384 --> 00:09:04,011
Maybe one day you
will be a Guru, too.

160
00:09:04,929 --> 00:09:09,726
This chakra deals with pleasure,
and is blocked by guilt.

161
00:09:09,934 --> 00:09:14,480
Now, look at all the guilt
which burdens you so.

162
00:09:15,231 --> 00:09:17,734
What do you blame
yourself for?

163
00:09:21,863 --> 00:09:23,406
AANG: I ran away.

164
00:09:34,250 --> 00:09:35,835
I hurt all of those people.

165
00:09:36,502 --> 00:09:40,298
Accept the reality
that these things happened,

166
00:09:40,423 --> 00:09:44,218
but do not let them cloud
and poison your energy.

167
00:09:44,761 --> 00:09:48,014
If you are to be a positive
influence on the world,

168
00:09:48,139 --> 00:09:50,933
you need to
forgive yourself.

169
00:09:56,564 --> 00:09:59,817
CHIEF HAKODA: This bay leads directly
to the outskirts of Ba Sing Se.

170
00:10:00,610 --> 00:10:02,278
We've been using
these tangle mines

171
00:10:02,403 --> 00:10:05,031
to stop the Fire Nation
ships from getting through.

172
00:10:05,573 --> 00:10:08,534
Your father invented
tangle mines, himself.

173
00:10:09,535 --> 00:10:12,079
Destructive, buoyant, and...

174
00:10:12,163 --> 00:10:13,164
( SNIFFING )

175
00:10:13,247 --> 00:10:14,665
( GASPS )

176
00:10:15,082 --> 00:10:16,542
...terrible smelling!

177
00:10:16,667 --> 00:10:17,960
Very perceptive.

178
00:10:18,085 --> 00:10:21,047
The mines are filled with
skunk-fish and seaweed.

179
00:10:21,130 --> 00:10:23,049
When a ship
detonates the mine,

180
00:10:23,132 --> 00:10:25,343
the seaweed tangles
up the propeller,

181
00:10:25,426 --> 00:10:29,347
and the foul smell forces
people to abandon the ship.

182
00:10:29,430 --> 00:10:32,308
I call it
the stink n' sink.

183
00:10:32,391 --> 00:10:35,520
( LAUGHING ) Good one, Dad!

184
00:10:35,603 --> 00:10:37,772
You are definitely
your father's son.

185
00:10:38,564 --> 00:10:41,901
Hakoda, our scouts have
spotted four Fire Nation ships.

186
00:10:42,318 --> 00:10:44,320
Bato, get these mines loaded up.

187
00:10:44,403 --> 00:10:46,864
The rest of you men,
prepare for battle.

188
00:10:49,075 --> 00:10:51,035
Um, what should I do, Dad?

189
00:10:51,327 --> 00:10:52,578
Aren't you listening?

190
00:10:52,662 --> 00:10:55,206
I said the rest of you men
get ready for battle.

191
00:11:04,340 --> 00:11:07,677
Who thought when we came
to this city as refugees,

192
00:11:07,802 --> 00:11:11,180
that I'd end up
owning my own tea shop.

193
00:11:11,264 --> 00:11:15,810
Follow your passion, Zuko,
and life will reward you.

194
00:11:16,269 --> 00:11:18,062
Congratulations, Uncle.

195
00:11:18,145 --> 00:11:19,814
I'm very thankful.

196
00:11:20,273 --> 00:11:21,732
You deserve it.

197
00:11:21,816 --> 00:11:24,610
The Jasmine Dragon will be
the best tea shop in the city.

198
00:11:25,069 --> 00:11:27,947
No, I'm thankful
because you decided

199
00:11:28,030 --> 00:11:30,658
to share this special
day with me.

200
00:11:30,741 --> 00:11:33,327
It means more
than you know.

201
00:11:35,288 --> 00:11:37,123
Now let's make these
people some tea.

202
00:11:39,083 --> 00:11:42,545
Yes, let's make some tea!

203
00:11:46,549 --> 00:11:50,094
Third is the Fire chakra,
located in the stomach.

204
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:52,763
My Fire chakra would
like to eat something

205
00:11:52,847 --> 00:11:54,348
other than onion-banana juice.

206
00:11:54,432 --> 00:11:55,641
( CHUCKLING )

207
00:11:55,725 --> 00:11:57,685
Good one. Moving on.

208
00:11:58,728 --> 00:12:03,482
This chakra deals with will power
and is blocked by shame.

209
00:12:03,608 --> 00:12:05,192
What are you ashamed of?

210
00:12:06,611 --> 00:12:09,655
What are your biggest
disappointments in yourself?

211
00:12:13,910 --> 00:12:16,078
I'm never gonna firebend again.

212
00:12:16,203 --> 00:12:17,538
I can't.

213
00:12:17,663 --> 00:12:19,457
You will never find balance,

214
00:12:19,582 --> 00:12:22,001
if you deny this part of your life.

215
00:12:22,710 --> 00:12:24,420
You are the Avatar,

216
00:12:24,503 --> 00:12:27,673
and therefore,
you are a Firebender.

217
00:12:28,507 --> 00:12:31,385
( INHALES, EXHALES )

218
00:12:33,054 --> 00:12:36,933
Hmm, that chakra opened
less like a flowing creek,

219
00:12:37,016 --> 00:12:38,434
and more like a...

220
00:12:38,726 --> 00:12:40,144
Burping bison.

221
00:12:40,227 --> 00:12:41,646
( BELCHES )

222
00:12:42,396 --> 00:12:47,026
Tastes like onions and bananas,
but, strangely, something else.

223
00:12:47,151 --> 00:12:48,653
Pickles?

224
00:12:49,278 --> 00:12:50,363
( SHRUGS )

225
00:12:55,493 --> 00:12:58,537
I'm tired of wearing
this girly disguise.

226
00:12:58,621 --> 00:13:00,748
I don't know how anyone
can fight in this.

227
00:13:00,831 --> 00:13:02,416
Maybe that's why
it was so easy

228
00:13:02,500 --> 00:13:05,378
to beat the Kyoshi Warriors
and take their clothes.

229
00:13:06,379 --> 00:13:08,923
How much longer do we have
to serve the Earth King?

230
00:13:09,006 --> 00:13:11,300
If I have to clean up one
more pile of bear poop,

231
00:13:11,384 --> 00:13:12,551
I'm gonna throw up.

232
00:13:13,177 --> 00:13:16,013
Princess Azula promised we
would go back to the Fire Nation

233
00:13:16,138 --> 00:13:18,140
as soon as we captured
the Avatar.

234
00:13:18,224 --> 00:13:20,518
- We just have to be patient.
- Shush up!

235
00:13:21,060 --> 00:13:23,646
Do you want the whole palace
to know we're Fire Nation?

236
00:13:24,105 --> 00:13:25,439
Sorry.

237
00:13:33,823 --> 00:13:35,199
Good work, girls.

238
00:13:35,324 --> 00:13:37,994
I am sure the Dai Li
will deliver the message.

239
00:13:40,079 --> 00:13:43,124
The fourth chakra
is located in the heart.

240
00:13:43,249 --> 00:13:47,211
It deals with love,
and is blocked by grief.

241
00:13:48,838 --> 00:13:51,590
Lay all your grief
out in front of you.

242
00:14:16,323 --> 00:14:20,286
GURU: You have, indeed, felt a great loss.

243
00:14:20,411 --> 00:14:27,251
But love is a form of energy,
and it swirls all around us.

244
00:14:27,376 --> 00:14:31,380
The Air Nomads' love for you
has not left this world.

245
00:14:31,505 --> 00:14:34,383
It is still inside of your heart,

246
00:14:34,508 --> 00:14:38,054
and is reborn in
the form of new love.

247
00:14:41,766 --> 00:14:44,101
Let the pain flow away.

248
00:14:46,145 --> 00:14:47,646
Very good.

249
00:14:49,065 --> 00:14:51,650
Can I have some
onion-banana juice, please?

250
00:14:53,819 --> 00:14:56,822
The fifth in the chain
is the Sound chakra,

251
00:14:56,906 --> 00:14:58,574
located in the throat.

252
00:14:59,158 --> 00:15:03,370
It deals with truth,
and is blocked by lies―

253
00:15:03,454 --> 00:15:05,498
The ones we tell ourselves.

254
00:15:06,165 --> 00:15:08,751
Why didn't you tell
us you were the Avatar?

255
00:15:09,376 --> 00:15:10,795
Because I never wanted to be.

256
00:15:11,295 --> 00:15:14,507
You cannot lie about your own nature.

257
00:15:14,632 --> 00:15:18,135
You must accept that
you are the Avatar.

258
00:15:18,260 --> 00:15:20,221
( INHALING, EXHALING )

259
00:15:30,314 --> 00:15:32,149
Very good, Aang.

260
00:15:32,233 --> 00:15:35,319
You have opened the chakra of Truth.

261
00:15:37,363 --> 00:15:40,741
The sixth pool of energy
is the Light chakra,

262
00:15:40,825 --> 00:15:43,702
located in the center
of the forehead.

263
00:15:44,078 --> 00:15:48,749
It deals with insight
and is blocked by illusion.

264
00:15:48,874 --> 00:15:51,252
The greatest illusion of this world

265
00:15:51,377 --> 00:15:54,171
is the illusion of separation.

266
00:15:54,296 --> 00:15:56,715
Things you think are
separate and different

267
00:15:56,799 --> 00:15:59,468
are actually one
and the same.

268
00:15:59,677 --> 00:16:01,512
AANG: Like the four nations.

269
00:16:01,595 --> 00:16:07,476
GURU: Yes, we are all one people,
but we live as if divided.

270
00:16:08,018 --> 00:16:09,687
We're all connected.

271
00:16:09,812 --> 00:16:11,605
Everything is connected.

272
00:16:11,730 --> 00:16:13,107
That's right.

273
00:16:13,232 --> 00:16:17,528
Even the separation
of the four elements is an illusion.

274
00:16:17,653 --> 00:16:19,238
If you open your mind,

275
00:16:19,363 --> 00:16:22,199
you will see that all
the elements are one―

276
00:16:22,283 --> 00:16:24,910
Four parts of the same whole.

277
00:16:24,994 --> 00:16:27,955
Even metal is just a part of Earth

278
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:30,916
that has been purified and refined.

279
00:16:33,460 --> 00:16:35,796
( INHALES, EXHALES )

280
00:16:38,716 --> 00:16:42,928
( STRAINING ) Come on metal... Budge.

281
00:16:43,179 --> 00:16:44,180
( METAL THUDS )

282
00:16:44,555 --> 00:16:46,891
Woo! Toph, you rule!

283
00:16:51,520 --> 00:16:52,605
What do you say, Momo?

284
00:16:52,688 --> 00:16:54,773
A cup of tea before
we get back to the king?

285
00:16:54,857 --> 00:16:56,400
( CHATTERING )

286
00:16:58,611 --> 00:16:59,987
Table for two, please.

287
00:17:00,529 --> 00:17:04,283
Uncle, I need two jasmine,
one green and one lychee.

288
00:17:04,408 --> 00:17:06,785
I'm brewing as fast as I can.

289
00:17:18,047 --> 00:17:19,965
AANG: This is the last chakra, isn't it?

290
00:17:20,049 --> 00:17:21,467
GURU: Yes.

291
00:17:21,550 --> 00:17:23,302
Once you open this chakra,

292
00:17:23,385 --> 00:17:27,139
you will be able go in and out
of the Avatar State at will.

293
00:17:27,223 --> 00:17:29,266
And when you are in
the Avatar State,

294
00:17:29,350 --> 00:17:31,185
you will have
complete control

295
00:17:31,268 --> 00:17:34,313
and awareness
of all your actions.

296
00:17:34,647 --> 00:17:36,023
Let's do this.

297
00:17:36,148 --> 00:17:40,361
The Thought chakra is located
at the crown of the head.

298
00:17:40,486 --> 00:17:43,530
It deals with pure cosmic energy

299
00:17:43,614 --> 00:17:46,617
and is blocked by earthly attachment.

300
00:17:46,742 --> 00:17:50,496
Meditate on what attaches
you to this world.

301
00:17:56,752 --> 00:18:01,006
Now, let all of those attachments go.

302
00:18:01,090 --> 00:18:03,801
Let them flow down the river...

303
00:18:03,884 --> 00:18:04,969
Forgotten.

304
00:18:05,552 --> 00:18:07,972
What? Why would I let go of Katara?

305
00:18:08,055 --> 00:18:10,391
I... I love her.

306
00:18:10,516 --> 00:18:12,559
Learn to let her go,

307
00:18:12,685 --> 00:18:15,271
or you cannot let the pure cosmic energy

308
00:18:15,396 --> 00:18:17,690
flow in from the universe.

309
00:18:17,815 --> 00:18:20,442
Why would I choose
cosmic energy over Katara?

310
00:18:20,567 --> 00:18:23,445
How could it be a bad thing that
I feel an attachment to her?

311
00:18:23,529 --> 00:18:25,614
Three chakras ago,
that was a good thing.

312
00:18:25,698 --> 00:18:28,409
You must learn to let go.

313
00:18:30,703 --> 00:18:32,538
( PANTING )

314
00:18:32,621 --> 00:18:34,248
Thank goodness you're here, Suki.

315
00:18:34,331 --> 00:18:35,958
Something terrible
is going on.

316
00:18:36,041 --> 00:18:37,960
The Fire Nation has
infiltrated the city.

317
00:18:38,043 --> 00:18:40,129
I just saw Prince Zuko
and his uncle!

318
00:18:40,462 --> 00:18:42,423
We have to tell
the Earth King right away!

319
00:18:42,548 --> 00:18:46,051
Oh, don't worry.
I'll be sure to let him know.

320
00:18:46,427 --> 00:18:48,095
( SCREECHES )

321
00:18:50,472 --> 00:18:51,557
( GASPS )

322
00:18:52,266 --> 00:18:53,475
( GRUNTS )

323
00:18:54,810 --> 00:18:57,271
AZULA: So, Zu Zu's in the city, too.

324
00:18:57,813 --> 00:19:00,649
I think it's time
for a family reunion.

325
00:19:01,233 --> 00:19:02,234
( CHATTERING )

326
00:19:02,943 --> 00:19:05,446
I'm sorry, but I can't
let go of Katara.

327
00:19:05,571 --> 00:19:08,699
Aang, to master the Avatar State,

328
00:19:08,824 --> 00:19:11,952
you must open
all the chakras.

329
00:19:12,077 --> 00:19:13,787
Surrender yourself.

330
00:19:13,912 --> 00:19:15,998
Okay, I'll try.

331
00:19:20,919 --> 00:19:25,674
GURU: Now, think of your attachments
and let them go.

332
00:19:25,799 --> 00:19:29,303
Let the pure cosmic energy flow.

333
00:19:54,870 --> 00:19:57,164
( KATARA SCREAMING )

334
00:19:57,289 --> 00:19:59,750
Let me go! ( STRAINING )

335
00:20:05,714 --> 00:20:07,049
( PANTING )

336
00:20:12,429 --> 00:20:14,431
( SCREAMING )

337
00:20:15,641 --> 00:20:18,185
Katara is in danger!
I have to go!

338
00:20:18,310 --> 00:20:19,895
No, Aang!

339
00:20:20,020 --> 00:20:23,023
By choosing attachment,
you have locked the chakra!

340
00:20:23,148 --> 00:20:27,361
If you leave now, you won't be able
to go into the Avatar State at all!

341
00:20:37,121 --> 00:20:38,831
( METAL CLANGS )

342
00:20:40,624 --> 00:20:42,292
It's another one of her tricks.

343
00:20:42,584 --> 00:20:44,461
There's a giant hole in the box.

344
00:20:44,586 --> 00:20:45,712
How is that a trick?

345
00:20:45,838 --> 00:20:48,715
It's not! It's the real deal!

346
00:20:58,392 --> 00:21:00,811
I am the greatest
Earthbender in the world!

347
00:21:00,936 --> 00:21:03,564
Don't you two dunderheads
ever forget!

348
00:21:13,490 --> 00:21:17,870
I'm going to be stuck in here
forever with you, aren't I?

349
00:21:18,412 --> 00:21:20,622
I have to go to the bathroom.

350
00:21:20,706 --> 00:21:22,207
( METAL CLANGS )

351
00:21:23,041 --> 00:21:25,711
Ready to go knock
some Fire Nation heads?

352
00:21:25,794 --> 00:21:28,172
You don't know how much
this means to me, Dad.

353
00:21:28,255 --> 00:21:29,381
I'll make you proud,

354
00:21:29,465 --> 00:21:32,134
and I'll finally prove to you
what a great warrior I am.

355
00:21:32,217 --> 00:21:35,262
Sokka, you don't have
to prove anything to me.

356
00:21:35,387 --> 00:21:37,055
I'm already proud of you,

357
00:21:37,181 --> 00:21:39,641
and I've always known
you were a great warrior.

358
00:21:39,933 --> 00:21:41,143
Really?

359
00:21:41,226 --> 00:21:44,605
Why do you think I trusted you
to look after our tribe when I left?

360
00:21:56,366 --> 00:21:57,743
This can't be good news.

361
00:22:08,921 --> 00:22:10,130
What is this about?

362
00:22:10,214 --> 00:22:13,467
Your agents show up in the middle
of the night and drag me down here?

363
00:22:13,550 --> 00:22:15,802
You will not treat
a Kyoshi Warrior this way!

364
00:22:16,094 --> 00:22:19,515
But you are not
a Kyoshi Warrior, are you,

365
00:22:19,598 --> 00:22:22,059
Princess Azula of the Fire Nation?

366
00:22:22,142 --> 00:22:24,895
- What do you want?
- I want to make a deal.

367
00:22:24,978 --> 00:22:28,190
It's time that I regain
control of Ba Sing Se,

368
00:22:28,315 --> 00:22:30,692
and you have
something I need.

369
00:22:31,235 --> 00:22:34,029
- Oh?
- The Earth King's trust.

370
00:22:34,154 --> 00:22:36,073
Why should I help you?

371
00:22:36,198 --> 00:22:39,451
Because I can get you the Avatar.

372
00:22:39,993 --> 00:22:41,119
I'm listening.

373
00:22:47,209 --> 00:22:48,752
A message from the royal palace.

374
00:22:51,505 --> 00:22:54,591
I... I can't believe it.

375
00:22:54,716 --> 00:22:58,136
- What is it, Uncle?
- Great news!

376
00:22:58,262 --> 00:23:03,225
We've been invited to serve
tea to the Earth King!

377
00:23:08,981 --> 00:23:10,357
( METAL DOOR SLAMS )
